1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,839
Welcome to our final week.

2
00:00:01,879 --> 00:00:04,002
Get comfortable, and let your breath settle.

3
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:07,353
Place a hand on your heart if that feels okay.

4
00:00:08,557 --> 00:00:12,036
This week, a lot of us are carrying uncertainty.

5
00:00:12,076 --> 00:00:13,471
About grades,

6
00:00:13,511 --> 00:00:17,342
jobs, what the future even looks like with AI in it.

7
00:00:17,382 --> 00:00:19,825
Let's meet that with some kindness.

8
00:00:19,865 --> 00:00:22,034
Silently say to yourself,

9
00:00:22,074 --> 00:00:24,642
may I be kind to myself in not knowing.

10
00:00:26,577 --> 00:00:29,250
May I trust that I can learn and adapt.

11
00:00:31,253 --> 00:00:33,314
May I remember what matters to me.

12
00:00:35,243 --> 00:00:40,251
Now, bring to mind a friend or classmate who's also stressed about the future.

13
00:00:40,291 --> 00:00:42,704
Send them the same wishes.

14
00:00:42,744 --> 00:00:45,212
May you be kind to yourself in not knowing.

15
00:00:46,699 --> 00:00:48,104
May you find your way.

16
00:00:49,608 --> 00:00:53,588
Finally, think of everyone your age trying to figure this out.

17
00:00:53,628 --> 00:00:55,437
May we all stay curious,

18
00:00:55,477 --> 00:00:57,070
thoughtful, and human.

19
00:00:58,510 --> 00:01:00,622
Notice how that feels.

20
00:01:00,662 --> 00:01:03,054
It makes sense to feel uncertain.

21
00:01:03,094 --> 00:01:07,284
Stay here for a few more minutes, breathing with that kindness.
